{"availability":"available","full":"grame-cncm/faust","name":"faust","description":"Functional programming language for signal processing and sound synthesis","category":"Other","language":"C++","stars":3178,"forks":429,"created":"2016-11-05T13:09:11Z","updated":"2026-10-08T14:03:10Z","license":null,"branch":"master-dev","homepage":"http://faust.grame.fr","topics":["audio","c","c-plus-plus","cmajor","compiler","cpp","csharp","dlang","dsp","faust","functional-programming","jax","jsfx","julia","julia-language","llvm","rnbo","rust","wasm"],"demo":"https://faustplayground.grame.fr/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:23.345Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:23.345Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:23.345Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:32.716Z","stars":3177,"forks":432},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:10.601Z","stars":3177,"forks":432},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:43.589Z","stars":3178,"forks":430},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:23.345Z","stars":3178,"forks":429}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Faust (Functional Audio Stream) is a functional programming language specifically designed for real-time signal processing and synthesis. A distinctive characteristic of Faust is that it is fully compiled.","The Faust compiler translates DSP specifications into very efficient code for various languages (C++, C, JAVA, LLVM IR, WebAssembly etc.) working at sample level. It targets high-performance signal processing applications, libraries, and audio plug-ins for a variety of audio platforms and standards. A same Faust specification can be used to easily generate various kinds of native standalone applications, iOS and Android apps, as well as Csound, LADSPA, Max/MSP, PD, Q, SuperCollider, VST, AU plugins, etc. (see the README in the /architecture folder for an exhaustive list).","While there are Faust contributors everywhere across the globe, Faust is mainly being developed at Grame, Centre National de Creation Musicale (), its birthplace."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md","fingerprint":"b3a3dd2f6191a45b3fce3671f2ed9c4db8b6f81714b8d3184095bc6c07ae9103","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:32.807Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:17.210Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Faust (Functional Audio Stream) is a functional programming language specifically designed for real-time signal processing and synthesis. A distinctive characteristic of Faust is that it is fully compiled.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Faust (Functional Audio Stream) is a functional programming language specifically designed for real-time signal processing and synthesis. A distinctive characteristic of Faust is that it is fully compiled.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b3a3dd2f6191a45b3fce3671f2ed9c4db8b6f81714b8d3184095bc6c07ae9103","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:17.210Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T14:03:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:17.211Z","hash":"b3a3dd2f6191a45b3fce3671f2ed9c4db8b6f81714b8d3184095bc6c07ae9103","originalBytes":12122,"storedBytes":12122,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["faust","git","libraries","architecture","program","app","submodule","documentation","project","py2max","tools","application","command","faust2ck","folder","line","node-matcher-plugin","various","commit","compilation","compile","compiler","etc.","examples","jack","oboe","online","scripts","version","add","android","audio","dsp","included","installation","latest","llvm","master","merge","push","remote","update","updated","alsa","available","binaries","code","contains","development","example